# Copy this file to mobile/.env (gitignored — never committed, survives
# every git pull) to override the API base URL for local testing without
# touching app.json, which is tracked and shared by everyone.
#
# Uncomment and set this when testing against your own local backend
# (npm run dev in backend/, usually http://localhost:4000):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000
#
# Leave mobile/.env absent (or this line commented out) to use
# app.json's expo.extra.apiUrl instead — the production backend.
#
# After creating or changing mobile/.env, restart the dev server
# completely (not just a browser refresh) for the change to take effect:
#   npx expo start --web --clear
